{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51585","headline":"瘗笔砖文（赵光逢薄游襄汉，濯足溪上，见一方砖碑，上题字云云。独孤贞节立。砖後积土如盎，微有苔藓，盖好事者瘗笔所在。） · 独孤贞节","name":"瘗笔砖文（赵光逢薄游襄汉，濯足溪上，见一方砖碑，上题字云云。独孤贞节立。砖後积土如盎，微有苔藓，盖好事者瘗笔所在。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秃友退锋郎，功成鬓发伤。\n冢头封马鬣，不敢负恩光。\n（《清异录》四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤贞节","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51585.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51585","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}